# The attract mode's captioned demo, played from the record demo_record.hex.
#
# Regenerate and check:
#   make pad-author SCRIPT=demo/demo.pad OUT=demo/demo.json
#   make demo-check
#
# The record is frozen: regenerating full_game never moves the demo. It is cut
# from worst-case/full_game.pad at its demo-record label:
#   make pad-author SCRIPT=worst-case/full_game.pad STOP_AT=demo-record OUT=tmp/demo_record.json
#   make replay EVENTS=tmp/demo_record.json SAVE_HEX=demo/demo_record.hex
#
# Pacing: the opening card idles 300 frames; each caption leads its command by
# 150 frames and stays 270 after it; the closing card is 180; at most 3600 frames.
from-record demo_record.hex
caption build a trading empire/across the stars
idle 300
label probe
caption probe the dark/to find new planets
idle 150
fold 118 307
idle 270
label colonize
caption colonize planets:/each one needs and makes goods
idle 150
colonise p32
idle 270
label slipway
caption link colonies with slipways/so goods can flow
idle 150
slipway p32 p55
idle 270
label year
caption end the year:/trade earns money and science
idle 150
year
idle 270
label tech
caption spend science on new tech
idle 150
research xenofoods
idle 270
label closing
caption slipways/press any button
idle 180
